sn12.64:7.3 | S: If there is no desire, relishing, and craving for consciousness as fuel, consciousness doesn’t become established there and doesn’t grow. | T: or for the nutriment consciousness, if there is no delight, if there is no craving, consciousness does not become established there and come to growth.
